    <string name="onboarding_a11y_title">Accessibility Service</string>
    <string name="onboarding_a11y_desc">ZugIt uses Android\'s Accessibility Service for ONE purpose: to paste your dictated text into the text field you are currently typing in.\n\nWhat it does:\n• Detects which text field is focused so it can insert the transcription there\n• Pastes your spoken words into that field\n\nWhat it does NOT do:\n• Does not read or collect content from other apps\n• Does not capture your screen\n• Does not transmit any data from other apps to our servers\n\nNOTE: If settings are \'Restricted\', tap the icon above to open App Info → 3 dots (top right) → \'Allow restricted settings\'.</string>
